## Quick Overview

**Pinodesk** - Desktop Point of Sale (POS) system
- Java 21, JavaFX 21, Spring Framework 6.0.7
- Spring Data JDBC, H2 Database, Flyway

### Build Commands (Use script.sh)
```bash
./script.sh build   # Build
./script.sh run     # Run app
./script.sh test    # Quality checks + tests
./script.sh fix     # Fix formatting
```

